      "text": "📊 5-TILE TELEMETRY METRICS ARRAY\n\n1. AIR QUALITY (AQI & PM2.5)\n   - getAQIStatus: Good(<=50), Mod(<=100), Unhealthy(Sens)(<=150)\n   - PM2.5 & PM10 particulate levels (µg/m³)\n\n2. UV INDEX SCALE\n   - getUVStatus: Low(<=2), Mod(<=5), High(<=7), Very High(>7)\n   - Solar protection & shade recommendations\n\n3. WIND BEARING COMPASS\n   - getCardinalDirection(angle / 45 % 8) -> N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW\n   - Wind speed in km/h & direction bearing in degrees\n\n4. DAYLIGHT CYCLE PROGRESS\n   - getDaylightProgress(sunrise, sunset) minute ratio calculation\n   - Gradient progress bar (amber-400 to rose-400)\n\n5. SURFACE PRESSURE\n   - Atmospheric pressure in hPa (standard baseline 1013 hPa)",
