      "x": 1015,
      "y": 225,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "🌐 HAVERSINE NEAREST CITIES ALGORITHM\n• Function: getNearestCities(currentLat, currentLon, currentName, 3)\n• Database: INDIAN_CITIES_REGISTRY (35+ major cities)\n• Haversine Formula:\n  d = 2R * asin(sqrt(sin²(Δlat/2) + cos(lat1)*cos(lat2)*sin²(Δlon/2)))\n  where R = 6371 km\n• Sorts by minimum distance & fetches parallel live temp\n• Renders 3 quick-switch city pills ('Mumbai 28°', 'Pune 26°')",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
