      "text": "⚙️ LANGGRAPH STATEFUL AGENT WORKFLOW\n\nState Node 1: Intent Classification\n- Determines query type: Weather Forecast vs Severe Alert vs Farmer Crop Guidance\n\nState Node 2: Prompt Engineering & Context Assembly\n- Injects language rules ('Respond exclusively in Gujarati script')\n- Injects crop rules if farmerMode is active:\n  'Give cotton irrigation, fertilizer & pest advice for current humidity'\n\nState Node 3: LLaMA Model Execution\n- Generates structured markdown response\n- Generates widget code blocks (`widget:weather {...}`)\n\nState Node 4: IMD Warning Overlay\n- Attaches active IMD bulletin alert cards if severe risk detected",
